{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-22",
  "title": "docket.tv | Narrative",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "docket.tv | Narrative"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We're building a specialized TV Guide CMS designed to revolutionize how broadcasters connect with viewers in the digital age. Think \"Twitch for public access TV\" - we're bridging the gap between traditional broadcasting and modern web-based viewing experiences."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Our platform enables seamless integration with cablecast APIs, allowing broadcasters to manage and display live content through a highly configurable, user-friendly TV guide interface. We focus on solving a critical problem in the broadcasting industry: the lack of modern, efficient tools for schedule management and viewer engagement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What sets us apart is our laser focus on the TV Guide experience. While competitors offer broad solutions, we're specifically tailored for broadcasters who need to enhance viewer engagement through superior scheduling and content discovery. Our platform supports real-time content updates, embeddable widgets, and comprehensive analytics, all while maintaining the community-driven spirit of public access TV."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With over 100,000 potential broadcasting organizations as our target market, we're positioned to revitalize grassroots broadcasting for the digital era. Our mission is to empower REAL PEOPLE to share their stories, facilitate authentic connections between broadcasters and viewers, and create a sanctuary for creators to learn and grow - all while leveraging legacy networks to reach new audiences."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}